{
  "uid": "mysql-ha-failover",
  "title": "5 \u00b7 Failover & Outages",
  "description": "Incident view: node, primary, router and application timelines side by side, plus the outage report.",
  "tags": [
    "mysql-ha"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "MySQL HA dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "mysql-ha"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(app_db_ops_total, application)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(app_db_ops_total, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "App writer path down/up",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "changes(app_db_probe_up{target=\"writer\"}[10s]) > 0",
        "step": "5s",
        "titleFormat": "{{application}}: writer path changed",
        "tagKeys": "application",
        "useValueForTime": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Primary changed",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "max by (member_host) (mysql_perf_schema_replication_group_member_info{member_role=\"PRIMARY\"}) unless max by (member_host) (mysql_perf_schema_replication_group_member_info{member_role=\"PRIMARY\"} offset 15s)",
        "step": "5s",
        "titleFormat": "new primary: {{member_host}}",
        "tagKeys": "member_host",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 5 \u00b7 Failover & Outages \u2014 what happened, in order?\nRead the timelines **top to bottom**: a node fails \u2192 the group elects a new primary \u2192 routers and HAProxy follow \u2192 the app's write path recovers.\nZoom the time range to the incident (drag on a graph). Purple marks = primary changed, red marks = app writer path down/up.\nThe exact start, end and first error of each outage are also in `GET /health/db` of the app."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Timeline",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "1. MySQL nodes up",
      "description": "Is each MySQL server reachable? Red = node down or killed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mysql_up",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "2. Who is primary",
      "description": "Green = this host is the PRIMARY at that moment. The switch from one host to another is the election.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (member_host) (mysql_perf_schema_replication_group_member_info{member_role=\"PRIMARY\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{member_host}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "-",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "PRIMARY",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "3. Routers usable for writes (HAProxy)",
      "description": "Green = HAProxy forwards write connections to this router. Both turn red while there is no primary: the routers close port 6446.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (server) (haproxy_server_status{proxy=\"routers_rw\", state=\"UP\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{server}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "4. App write / read path",
      "description": "Green = the app's 1-second probe succeeds. The red width is the outage as the application saw it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "app_db_probe_up{application=~\"$application\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} ({{mode}}) {{target}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Outage report (from the app's probe)",
      "id": 7,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Last outage started",
      "description": "Time of the first failed probe of the last outage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "app_db_outage_last_start_seconds{application=~\"$application\"} * 1000 > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{target}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "dateTimeAsIso",
          "noValue": "none yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Last outage ended",
      "description": "Time of the first successful probe after it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "app_db_outage_last_end_seconds{application=~\"$application\"} * 1000 > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{target}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "dateTimeAsIso",
          "noValue": "none yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Last outage duration",
      "description": "End minus start.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "app_db_outage_last_duration_seconds{application=~\"$application\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{target}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "none yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Outages (range)",
      "description": "Finished outages in the selected range, per app and path.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (application, target) (round(increase(app_db_outage_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{target}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Impact on the application",
      "id": 12,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors absorbed by retry / min, by MySQL error",
      "description": "Which errors the failover produced. 1290 = switchover, 2013 / 08S01 = connection lost, pool-timeout = no connection within 3 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (application, error) (increase(app_db_attempt_errors_total{application=~\"$application\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{error}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency incl. retries (max)",
      "description": "The longest operation: roughly the failover time the user waited.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (application, kind) (app_db_op_seconds_max{application=~\"$application\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed operations / min",
      "description": "Should stay 0: the outage became latency, not errors.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (application, kind) (increase(app_db_ops_total{outcome=\"failed\",application=~\"$application\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    }
  ]
}